# {{.ProjectName}}

A modern, high-performance web application built with **Go**, **[Templ](https://templ.guide)** (Compile-time Type-safe HTML Components), **[HTMX 2.0](https://htmx.org)** & **Tailwind CSS**.

## ✨ Architecture Highlights
- 🐹 **Go Fiber v2**: Ultra-fast, Express-like HTTP web framework.
- 🧩 **Templ Components**: Zero-runtime HTML templating with full compile-time Go type-safety and syntax checking.
- ⚡ **HTMX 2.0**: SPA-like dynamic reactivity and partial page swaps with zero client-side JavaScript bundle overhead.
- 🎨 **Tailwind CSS**: Modern, utility-first styling.

## 🚀 Getting Started

### 1. Run the Development Server
```bash
go run cmd/web/main.go
# Or using Umaru CLI:
umaru dev
```

Open your browser at [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080).

### 2. Live Templ Generation (Optional)
If you install the Templ CLI (`go install github.com/a-h/templ/cmd/templ@latest`), you can run:
```bash
templ generate --watch --cmd="go run cmd/web/main.go"
```

## 📁 Directory Structure
```
├── cmd/
│   └── web/
│       └── main.go          # Application entrypoint & HTTP server
├── internal/
│   └── handlers/            # Fiber route handlers & HTMX endpoints
├── views/
│   ├── layout/              # Base HTML template shell & navigation
│   ├── pages/               # Full page Templ views
│   └── components/          # Reusable, reactive HTMX partials
└── public/                  # Static assets (CSS, icons)
```
